                                                "sense_id": "1f6176fb-0e53-3c6c-919e-92752c9a7eee",
                                                "text": "The GWML is now electrified - and from early next year, Intercity Express Trains will be able to run from London-Cardiff Central completely on electric power. That will enable the biggest timetable shake-up since 1976."
